  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a vibrant sanctuary with the Jeminise Softball Comforter Set, designed for passionate softball players and fans. This set offers a comfortable and stylish way to show your love for the game.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Celebrate your passion for softball with a comforter set that reflects the courage and dedication of the game.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to perfectly fit your bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Craftsmanship:</strong> Features an eco-friendly finishing process that helps colors stay vibrant, along with smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Durable Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and durable feel that is fade-resistant and more breathable than cotton.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for convenience, this comforter set is machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize your bedding with two text input options available.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a comfortable comforter, making it a complete bedding solution.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses for Product</th>\n<td>Napping, Reading, Travel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Pieces</th>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
